# Agent workbench — local scratch only. One-off task scripts and generated
# artifacts live here so they never reach the repository root, and they are not
# source: they are the residue of a task, not its result. The README is the one
# tracked file, because the rules have to survive the cleanup.
ai/workbench/scripts/
ai/workbench/artifacts/
!ai/workbench/README.md
